record('bangladesh-adb-response','Bangladesh: ongoing work, comparator awards and corrective action','ADB’s contract table also lists India’s Transrail, Korean Hanbaek and Chinese contractors on different packages. Borrower monitoring records package3 at about85% inJune2025 and a rejected April2025 monitoring submission, followed by a new vendor and expected resubmission. No programme GRM grievances were reported as referred to court in that reporting period.','response','2025-06-30',['adb-bangladesh-project-indexed','adb-monitoring-2025'],['adb','bangladesh','pgcb','lt','ban-package3','aiib'],[],B,'/foreign','Development purpose, corrective action and incomplete work are retained. Zero reported GRM referrals is not a comprehensive no-litigation finding. No later package3 completion, final court outcome or contractor payment ledger was verified. No outreach occurred.',['Different contractors on different packages offer a control against inferring national exclusivity.','Environmental reporting deficiencies require correction but do not alone establish diverted finance.'],'Later independent completion, accepted monitoring, project audit and payment certificates would resolve status and cash attribution.',asof='2026-08-03',tier='self-reported',g=bg,limits=['Package8 termination belongs to a different contract and must not be assigned to L&T.'])
