record('ida-budget-support','IDA → India’s budget: actual disbursement with no contractor trace','P174027’sSDR77m concessional credit68130 andUS$291.4m non-concessional credit68120 were approved15December2020. The2024ICR reportsUS$402,601,860 actual disbursement equivalent and closure31December2022. Proceeds enter the Union’s RBI account and Consolidated Fund; the programme document explicitly excludes tracing them to specifically agreed activities.','financing-instrument','2020-12-15',['ida-pmgky-pd','ida-pmgky-icr'],['ida','india','ida-p174027','dea'],['ida-india-p174027','ida-p174027-dea'],F+['public-finance','welfare'],'/finance','ICR footnote1 expressly attributes actual disbursement differing from approval to SDR/USD exchange-rate fluctuation, using WFACS data of8April2024. ICR rates the two-operation series Highly Satisfactory; these are programme assessments, not contractor-payment proof. The legacy raw finance fleet supplied discovery; original PD/ICR were newly retrieved and checked.',['TheUSD402.60m actual versusUSD400m approval reflects mixed currency reporting; the values cannot by themselves establish an overrun.'],'Reconcile credit-level withdrawals and FX translation to Treasury receipts; require separate appropriation/payment evidence for any corporate beneficiary claim.',[cash(77,'original concessional credit principal','2020 proposal/approved operation','XDR','million SDR'),cash(291400000,'non-concessional credit principal','2020 approved operation'),cash(402601860,'ICR actual disbursement in USD equivalent','ICR2024-04-22')],asof='2024-04-22',end='2022-12-31',status='closed; disbursement verified at programme level; no specific corporate pass-through',limits=['This is a reviewed supplement to retained P174027, not an additional loan to add again to corpus totals.','Cover-page first-operation instrument-label errors in ICR are avoided by using the credit-level financing tables.'])
